Get back into your network from outside it

Usage:
  olr remote [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Let a device dial in
  disable     Stop accepting connections from outside
  enable      Start accepting connections from outside
  fix         Clear what is standing in remote access's way on this box
  rm          Stop a device dialling in
  set         Set how devices reach this box
  show        Show remote-access configuration
  status      Show whether each way in is working

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for remote

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr remote [command] --help" for more information about a command.
